{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Getting the Client", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Teamwork", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 5, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 9, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.2", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Present advice on solving technical problems in a work context and appropriate for the interlocutor. ", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn7le09ob05re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Present Continuous", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "<p>The <span class=\"strong\">Present Continuous</span> tense is normally used to talk about an action happening in the present or at the moment.</p><p>However, it can also be used to indicate future. It expresses the idea that something will (or will not) happen in the future. </p><p>The future can be noticed through the use of a future word.</p>", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "The <span class=\"strong\">Present Continuous</span> tense is formed by <span class=\"italic\">be</span> and the present participle (<span class=\"italic\">-ing</span>) of a verb. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":4,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Affirmative </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I<br/>He / She / It<br/>You / We / They</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">'m / am<br/>'s / is <br/>'re / are</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">discussing our strategy today.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Interrogative</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Am<br/> Is<br/> Are\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I<br/>he / she / it<br/>you / we / they</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">discussing our strategy today?</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "Using the <span class=\"strong\">Present Continuous</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<ul><li>You can use it to describe actions, situations or things that are in progress at the moment of speaking. <br/> <span class=\"italic\">Today, we'<span class=\"strong\">re discussing</span> our main strategy for the European market.</span></li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<ul><li>The Present Continuous is also used to describe actions or situations that are in progress around the present, but not necessarily at the moment of speaking.<br/> <span class=\"italic\">The politician <span class=\"strong\">is</span> visit<span class=\"strong\">ing</span> Toronto to discuss elections.</span></li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<ul><li>When describing changes and trends you can also the <span class=\"strong\">Present Continuous</span>. <br/> <span class=\"italic\">People <span class=\"strong\">are not</span> think<span class=\"strong\">ing</span> about elections.<br/>The companies <span class=\"strong\">are</span> compet<span class=\"strong\">ing</span> fiercely. </span></li></ul>", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Making Suggestions and Giving Advice ", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Sometimes you have an idea, a recommendation or plan that you think could work for your company. It is important to use proper language to offer those ideas for someone to consider. Here is some language you can use for making suggestions and giving advice.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "<ol><li value=\"1\">You can use <span class=\"italic\">How do</span>/<span class=\"italic\">does </span>+ subject + verb and <span class=\"italic\">should ...</span> + verb to ask for suggestions or advice. <br/> <span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">How do we ensure</span> that our goals meet their objectives? <br/> <span class=\"strong\">Should we send</span> one of our staff there to establish new connections?</span></li></ol>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<ol><li value=\"2\"> You can make suggestions and give advice using the preposition <span class=\"italic\">by</span> + <span class=\"italic\">-ing</span> <br/> <span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">By</span> focus<span class=\"strong\">ing</span> on the approaches that have worked for us so far.</span></li></ol>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<ol><li value=\"3\">If you want your suggestion/advice to sound polite, you use <span class=\"italic\">might </span>+ verb, <span class=\"italic\">might like/want</span> + <span class=\"italic\">to</span> + verb or <span class=\"italic\">might be better off</span> + <span class=\"italic\">-ing</span>. <br/><span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">It might be worth</span> send<span class=\"strong\">ing</span> one of our staff there to prepare the ground.<br/>We <span class=\"strong\">might be better off</span> send<span class=\"strong\">ing</span> one of our staff there to do some research.<br/>It <span class=\"strong\">might be</span> possible to send one of our staff there to build connections.</span></li></ol>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<ol><li value=\"4\">If you want to make the suggestion/advice less direct, you use <span class=\"italic\">could</span>. <br/><span class=\"italic\">You <span class=\"strong\">could make</span> a stop in Sao Paulo on your way there.</span><br/></li></ol>", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to target", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to focus or make contact with", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We meet our communication objectives by targeting the appropriate audience.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le09ob05aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use when coming up with solutions in the workplace.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "influencer ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a person who can affect opinions or decision-making", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Knowing the right influencers can help us meet our communication objectives. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le09ob05aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "field survey ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a set of questions to ask a large group of people in a particular area", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I usually rely heavily on field surveys for my research. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le09ob05aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "focus group", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a small group of people who are interviewed or studied together by a company or researcher", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I greatly benefit from focus group studies.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le09ob05aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "prepare the ground", "type": "name"}, {"content": "doing the tasks necessary to get ready for the main work", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It might be worthwhile to send Ferdinand on a trip to prepare the ground.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le09ob05aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "comparative study", "type": "name"}, {"content": "research that compares and contrasts two or more focus areas", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It might be possible to do a comparative study.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le09ob05aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "uniform ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "standard, having the same or even results", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We can't assume Colombian and Brazilian markets are uniform.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le09ob05aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "federal election", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a political event during which the leader and party are chosen to lead the country, usually through public votes", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The federal election happened last month so people are no longer thinking about it.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le09ob05aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Think of two issues that are currently happening in your country or workplace.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a dialogue of 10-12 lines.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "In the dialogue, make sure you describe the problems and come up with solutions to deal with the problems.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "When you are finished, proofread the dialogue and read it aloud with a partner.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I identify current, local issues.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I come up with solutions to deal with problems.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I read my solutions to problems aloud to another person.", "type": "text"}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn7le09ob05re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn7le09ob05re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"image": "engenn7le09ob05re2img05.jpg", "text": "", "time": "0", "id": 0}, {"image": "engenn7le09ob05re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Today we're discussing our research strategy for South America. How do we establish realistic goals to meet our communications objectives?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Ferdinand</span>: By targeting the appropriate audiences and the right influencers.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: How do we determine that from here?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Ferdinand</span>: We might obtain a lot from online surveys but I usually rely heavily on field surveys.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: I greatly benefit from focus group studies.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Ferdinand</span>: Impossible to organize from here.", "time": "100", "id": 1}, {"image": "engenn7le09ob05re2img06.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Any suggestions?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Rocco</span>: It might be worth the investment sending Ferdinand on a trip to prepare the ground, do some research, build new connections ... what's going on politically in Colombia now?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Ferdinand</span>: Ah, the timing is perfect because the president is visiting Bogota to discuss the  trade this month.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Rocco, I'm in agreement if you are convinced of the returns.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Rocco</span>: Jet lines are competing fiercely at the moment. We might be better off having Ferdinand take a multiple destination flight. That way, it might be possible to do a comparative study.", "time": "26000", "id": 2}, {"image": "engenn7le09ob05re2img07.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Ferdinand</span>: What are you thinking ... ?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Rocco</span>: Well, I know your family is living in Brazil now. You could make connections in Sao Paulo. We can't assume Colombian and Brazilian markets are uniform.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Ferdinand</span>: You're absolutely right.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: What's currently happening in Brazil?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Ferdinand</span>: The federal election happened last month so people are no longer thinking about politics.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Sounds good. Let's approach Janet.", "time": "59000", "id": 3}]}}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " I can come up with solutions to support the team.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about jobs and work.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about things happening right now.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " What do you do when you have a problem at work or at school? ", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " How do you solve the problem? Do you ask for advice or suggestions from other people?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "Let's come up with a solution!", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "img_path": "", "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " This training should have many <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_0\">returns</span>!", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Content", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Listening", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}]}, {"content": [{"content": "<span class=\"italic\">\"Returns\"</span> are profits or good results which come back to a person after investing time, money or effort.", "tip_id": 0, "type": "text"}], "type": "tips"}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Instructions: Click on the play button to listen to the audio.", "type": "text"}]}], "questions": [{"responses": [{"_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "correct": 0, "id": 0, "selected": 0}, {"_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "correct": 1, "id": 1, "selected": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}], "id": 0}], "type": "STI", "id": 1, "stimuli_ids": [1]}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " Let's solve some issues in your homeland!", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Take Away", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Writing", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Speaking", "type": "skill"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "\nInstructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self-Assessment.\n", "type": "text"}]}], "questions": [{"responses": [{"_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "correct": 1, "id": 0, "selected": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "engenn7le09ob05re7pdf01.pdf", "type": "pdf"}]}], "id": 0}], "type": "DWS", "id": 2, "stimuli_ids": []}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "What are they talking about at the meet